

# Run output, including trace/scratch/ — the sanctioned home for a checker's throwaway probe, so it
# cannot be mistaken for project code or survive as unmaintained proof (loop/checker-prompt.md).
# The adoption baseline is durable cross-session state, not run output; keep it tracked so a clone
# inherits the same debt boundary and ratchets.
trace/*
!trace/adoption-baseline.json

# --- harness: run output. Regenerated every run; committing it is pure diff noise.
harness/trace/*
!harness/trace/adoption-baseline.json
harness/loop/current.json
harness/loop/route-log.jsonl
harness/env/local.json
harness/env/secrets.env

# --- Node project (package.json at repo root)
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
.cache/
